WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
It was going to cost them a fortune, and I said,

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.000
and wait till you see the overruns.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.360
Well, I turned out to be right.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.780
They had massive cost overruns and spent between $2

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.880
and $4 billion on the building

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.920
and did not even get the marble floors that I promised them.

